     ---                                                                        
                                                                                
     **Your genotype-qc options for HWE filtering:**                            
                                                                                
     The genotype-qc skill runs PLINK with HWE filtering built in. Here are     
     the key parameters for your use case:                                      
                                                                                
     | Parameter | Description | Default |                                      
     |-----------|-------------|---------|                                      
     | --hwe_pvalue | HWE p-value threshold | 1e-6 |                            
     | --maf | Minor allele frequency | 0.05 |                                  
     | --geno_missing | SNP missing rate | 0.05 |                               
     | --individual_missing | Sample missing rate | 0.05 |                      
                                                                                
     ---                                                                        
                                                                                
     **Datasets I found in your workspace (testdata/):**                        
                                                                                
     | Prefix | Description |                                                   
     |--------|-------------|                                                   
     | testdata/testps | Test pig data |                                        
     | testdata/reference | Reference panel |                                   
     | testdata/simulated_population_chr1_part | Simulated chr1 subset |        
                                                                                
     ---                                                                        
                                                                                
     **To run HWE-only QC on your genotype data:**                              
                                                                                
     ```bash                                                                    
     conda activate piggpa                                                      
     bash                                                                       
     /workspace/pigbole/.piggpa/skills/piggpa-G/genotype-qc/scripts/genotyp     
     e_qc.sh \                                                                  
       --genotype_prefix <your_plink_prefix> \                                  
       --outdir <output_dir> \                                                  
       --hwe_pvalue 1e-6 \                                                      
       --maf 0 \                                                                
       --geno_missing 1 \                                                       
       --individual_missing 1                                                   
     ```                                                                        
                                                                                
     Setting `--maf 0`, `--geno_missing 1`, and `--individual_missing 1`        
     effectively disables those filters so only the HWE filter is applied.      
                                                                                
     **If you want HWE filtering along with standard QC, don't override the     
     defaults — just specify your genotype prefix and the HWE p-value:**        
                                                                                
     ```bash                                                                    
     bash                                                                       
     /workspace/pigbole/.piggpa/skills/piggpa-G/genotype-qc/scripts/genotyp     
     e_qc.sh \                                                                  
       --genotype_prefix <your_plink_prefix> \                                  
       --outdir output/genotype-qc \                                            
       --hwe_pvalue 1e-6                                                        
     ```                                                                        
                                                                                
     ---                                                                        
                                                                                
